<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>59man.shop으로 이동 중...</title>

    <!-- Open Graph (OG) 태그 -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="N-Telecom 59만 요금제">
    <meta property="og:description" content="59man.shop에서 최고의 요금제를 확인하세요!">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://59man.shop/images/thumbnail.jpg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://59man.shop">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">

    <script>
        // 즉시 리디렉션
        window.location.replace("https://59man.shop");
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 50px;
        }
        .container {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .thumbnail {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .btn {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background-color: #ff6600;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #cc5500;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>잠시만 기다려 주세요...</h1>
    <p>59man.shop으로 이동 중입니다. 이동되지 않는다면 <a href="https://59man.shop">여기</a>를 클릭하세요.</p>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- 썸네일 이미지 -->
        <img class="thumbnail" src="https://59man.shop/images/thumbnail.jpg" alt="59man Thumbnail">

        <!-- 버튼 -->
        <a href="https://59man.shop" class="btn">바로 가기</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
